{"c":[{"name":"20261002T100848Z-2317db88abe7ef57","text":"Chrome names its top AXGroup after the window title and AXWebArea after the page title; keep both out of element keys or every key moves on a title change (E8).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T100848Z-7a26e801e62c7446","text":"Chrome and Helium reject AXManualAccessibility (-25205) but still expose web AX; Electron apps accept it. Web pages post no AX notification for DOM text, insert or remove changes (E1).","type":"note"}]}
